    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I (Polymer)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II (Nature)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/99cb8d71-dde7-407c-b6d8-2462093ec4e2-image.png\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Thermosetting polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7a74bcc7-6c39-4cab-aa7e-b711911daebf-image.png\" style=\"width: 281px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Fibers</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/580d1b2e-a434-46bc-aa4a-028da505c131-image.png\" style=\"width: 119px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Elastomer</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/22aecd89-6acf-45ea-a129-afbb66d2fc2e-image.png\" style=\"width: 242px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Thermoplastic polymer</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
